      {
        "id": 27406,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-15T20:08:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No.<br>\nEach ‘instance’ of damage is a separate source, thus it would be reduced by the likes of fortitude (or increased by phosphorescent chamber) but not by shielding winds.</p>\n<p>Shielding winds would work on something like Omnitron’s disintegration ray</p>\n<p>(Looking for a second “You’re right” from one of the designer guys in a single day!)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:01:22.815Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 5614,
        "topic_slug": "q-shielding-winds",
        "display_username": "Matchstickman",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "No.\nEach 'instance' of damage is a separate source, thus it would be reduced by the likes of fortitude (or increased by phosphorescent chamber) but not by shielding winds.\n\nShielding winds would work on something like Omnitron's disintegration ray\n\n(Looking for a second \"You're right\" from one of the designer guys in a single day!)",
